<title>USA: Woolworth Aug same-store sales fall 0.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Woolworth Aug same-store sales fall 0.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK, N.Y. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		 $737	 $742	-0.8	 -0.1</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $4,456     $4,492	-0.8	 +0.4</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is   four weeks ended Aug 31.</p>
<p>    Full company name is			   Woolworth Corp.</p>
<p>NOTE: Excluding the effect of translation rates, particularly as related to German operations, sales for the four-week period decreased 0.4 percent and sales for the 30-week period increased 0.5 percent.</p>
<p>Sales of businesses disposed of during 1995 and 1996 have been excluded from calculations.</p>
</text>
